---
// Knight Capital, SEC Release 34-70694: 212 parent orders in, over 4 million executions out, in about 45 minutes.
---
<div class="qfig-atq22i">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 170" role="img" aria-label="Orders in and out of the router. In: 212 small parent orders. Out: more than 4 million executions in 154 stocks within about 45 minutes. No control compared the two.">
    <text x="20" y="18" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>One router, two counts nobody compared</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Một bộ định tuyến, hai con số không ai so sánh</tspan></text>
    <rect x="20" y="44" width="150" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="95" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="num">212</text>
    <text x="95" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>parent orders in</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lệnh mẹ vào</tspan></text>
    <polygon points="178,78 232,78 232,70 250,84 232,98 232,90 178,90" class="arr" />
    <rect x="258" y="44" width="110" height="80" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="313" y="88" text-anchor="middle" class="n">SMARS</text>
    <polygon points="376,78 430,78 430,70 448,84 430,98 430,90 376,90" class="arr bad" />
    <rect x="456" y="36" width="110" height="96" rx="6" class="box bad" />
    <text x="511" y="72" text-anchor="middle" class="num bad-t">4M+</text>
    <text x="511" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>executions out</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lượt khớp ra</tspan></text>
    <text x="511" y="110" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>in about 45 min</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trong ~45 phút</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-atq22i svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .qfig-atq22i text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-atq22i .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq22i .n { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq22i .num { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-atq22i .bad-t { fill: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq22i .s { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-atq22i .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-atq22i .box.bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .qfig-atq22i .arr { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .qfig-atq22i .arr.bad { fill: var(--red); }
</style>
